# Per-Dockerfile ignore file for Dockerfile.runtime (BuildKit uses this
# instead of .dockerignore when building with -f Dockerfile.runtime).
#
# The main .dockerignore excludes the whole build tree (the release
# Dockerfile compiles in-container and never needs it), but the runtime
# image is copy-only: it needs exactly the three prebuilt binaries in
# build/apps. Keep the context tiny by excluding everything else.
#
# Note: dockerignore follows gitignore semantics, so the children of the
# build tree are excluded individually and the binaries re-included.

.git
.cache
build/*
!build/apps
build/apps/*
!build/apps/ninfer
!build/apps/ninfer-serve
!build/apps/ninfer-perplexity

**/__pycache__
**/.venv
